# Nouman Portfolio Context

Before editing this site, read **`PROJECT.md`** at the repo root. It documents architecture, sections, design tokens, `initUI` behavior, and known caveats.

## Critical patterns

- Single-page React + Vite portfolio. No router. Sections are composed in `App.jsx`.
- Almost all styles live in `src/App.css` (dark purple/cyan design tokens). Prefer those tokens over inventing new colors.
- Interactivity (typed text, nav stuck, mobile menu, scroll reveal, skill bars, counters, tabs, project filters, testimonials slider, contact form mock) lives in `src/components/index.js` via `initUI()`. Preserve required IDs/`data-*`/classes or update `initUI` in the same change.
- Content is hardcoded in each component under `src/components/`.
- New JSX should use `className` / `htmlFor` (not HTML `class` / `for`).
- Contact form is mock-only — no backend unless explicitly adding one.
- Brand: Nouman — WordPress / WooCommerce / PHP developer; logo mark `N.`
